## `> ./projects`

### `01` ⏱️ `5minchat`

```text
PROJECT     : 5minchat
TYPE        : Anonymous timed chat platform
STATUS      : LIVE
```

Talk to a stranger for exactly 5 minutes — no profiles, no history, no persistent
identity. Built around a server-authoritative matchmaking engine and timer, layered
with a full social platform: posts, follows, comments, and Instagram-style @handles.

**FEATURES**

```text
[✓] Server-authoritative 5-minute matchmaking timer
[✓] Zero-login, zero-identity anonymous chat core
[✓] Profanity / obfuscation moderation + rate limiting
[✓] Report, block, and leave controls
[✓] Mutual opt-in friend system
[✓] Save Chat (client-side .txt export)
[✓] Social feed — photo posts, likes, comments, follow/unfollow
[✓] Google + email auth (Supabase)
[✓] @handle system with live availability checks
[✓] Light / dark theme, custom SVG icon set
```

**STACK**

`React` `Vite` `Node.js` `Express` `Socket.IO` `Supabase` `Cloudinary`

🌐 **Live:** https://5minchat.online  
📂 **Repository:** *(add your repo link here)*

